data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"reasoning_content":"Page has paddingLeft=16px and paddingRight=16px. So content width is 1280 - 32 = 1248. Card should be centered in content area: (1248 - 301.078)/2 = 473.46. But card.left is 485.45. Wait that's not matching. Let me recalculate.\n\nActually card.left is relative to viewport. Page.left=0, Page.padding=16. Content starts at 16. Content width = 1248. Card width = 301.078. Center of content = 16 + 1248/2 = 640. Card center = card.left + width/2 = 485.453 + 150.539 = 635.992. Difference from 640 = 4.008.\n\nHmm. 640 - 635.992 = 4.008. But content area starts at 16 and width 1248, so center is at 16 + 624 = 640. Card center should be at 640. It's at 635.99. Where's the 4px coming from? Maybe Card has a border of 4px on the left? Let me check.\n\nActually maybe the card has `box-sizing: border-box` and the width includes padding/border. If it has padding-left, the content area is shifted. Or maybe the h1 has margin that affects the card width measurement? No, card.width is the element's width.\n\nLet me just measure more precisely. The 4px offset could be due to the Card's own padding or border being included but the visual content not centered. Wait, card.width = 301.078 includes padding and border (border-box). If card has paddingLeft=16 and paddingRight=16, then the inner content width is 269.078. The h1 is centered within the content area, so h1 center = card.left + 16 + 269.078/2 = card.left + 150.539. That's what I computed. But the Page content center is 640. So 4px off.\n\nActually, perhaps the Page has padding-left=16, but Card has margin-left implicitly? No, marginLeft=0.\n\nMaybe the issue is that the Page's `alignItems: center` centers the Card as a flex item, but with padding, the flex container's content box width is 1248, and the card is centered in that. So card.left should be 16 + (1248 - 301.078)/2 = 16 + 473.461 = 489.461. But actual card.left = 485.453. Difference = 4.008.\n\nWait, that 4.008 is exactly half of... something? Or maybe my xOff calculation is wrong. Page center x = page.left + page.width/2 = 0 + 640 = 640. Card center x = card.left + card.width/2 = 485.453 + 150.539 = 635.992. Difference = 4.008.\n\nBut if card is centered in Page content area, its center should be at Page content center = 16 + 624 = 640. So it should be at 640 - 150.539 = 489.461. Actual = 485.453. Difference = 4.008.\n\nSo the card is shifted left by 4px relative to the expected center. This could be due to the card's border-left being 4px? Or the Page has pseudo-element? Or maybe my measurement is sub-pixel imprecise. 4px is small.\n\nActually, I think this is sub-pixel measurement precision from fractional widths. Card width is 301.078125. Half = 150.5390625. Page width/2 = 640. 640 - 150.5390625 = 489.4609375. Card.left = 485.453125. Difference = 4.0078125.\n\nHmm. What if Page has a 4px border on the right or left? Let me check. Page style said border? I didn't include border. Let me check borders."},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959726,"id":"chatcmpl-bfd224a3e0624ee191c2b3fe56c4e8b4","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

data: {"choices":[{"delta":{"tool_calls":[{"function":{"arguments":"{\"command\": \"node -e \\\"\\nconst puppeteer = require('puppeteer');\\n(async () =\u003e {\\n  const browser = await puppeteer.launch({ headless: true, executablePath: '/usr/bin/chromium-browser', args: ['--no-sandbox', '--disable-setuid-sandbox'] });\\n  const page = await browser.newPage();\\n  await page.setViewport({ width: 1280, height: 800 });\\n  await page.goto('http://localhost:5173/', { waitUntil: 'networkidle2' });\\n  await new Promise(r =\u003e setTimeout(r, 1000));\\n  const styles = await page.evaluate(() =\u003e {\\n    const p = document.querySelector('[data-component=\\\\\\\"Page\\\\\\\"]');\\n    const c = document.querySelector('[data-component=\\\\\\\"Card\\\\\\\"]');\\n    const s = p ? window.getComputedStyle(p) : null;\\n    const cs = c ? window.getComputedStyle(c) : null;\\n    return {\\n      page: p ? { paddingLeft: s.paddingLeft, paddingRight: s.paddingRight, borderLeft: s.borderLeftWidth, borderRight: s.borderRightWidth, marginLeft: s.marginLeft, marginRight: s.marginRight, width: s.width } : null,\\n      card: c ? { paddingLeft: cs.paddingLeft, paddingRight: cs.paddingRight, borderLeft: cs.borderLeftWidth, borderRight: cs.borderRightWidth, marginLeft: cs.marginLeft, marginRight: cs.marginRight, width: cs.width } : null,\\n    };\\n  });\\n  console.log(JSON.stringify(styles, null, 2));\\n  await browser.close();\\n})();\\n\\\"\", \"workdir\": \"/tmp\", \"timeout\": 120000}","name":"bash"},"id":"bash_43","index":0,"type":"function"}]},"finish_reason":null,"index":0,"raw_output":null}],"created":1789959726,"id":"chatcmpl-bfd224a3e0624ee191c2b3fe56c4e8b4","model":"accounts/fireworks/models/kimi-k2p7-code","object":"chat.completion.chunk","usage":null}

